            ]
          },
          "710390104": {
            "id": "710390104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "...!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390105"
            ]
          },
          "710390105": {
            "id": "710390105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yikes! Y—You scared me!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390106"
            ]
          },
          "710390106": {
            "id": "710390106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Jinwu",
            "text": "S—Sorry. Anyway, um, if you're looking for Zhiqiong... she left."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7103903",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Muning about Zhiqiong's departure",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710390201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710390201": {
            "id": "710390201",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Hmm? Zhiqiong's not with you? Word's come down from the Ministry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390202"
            ]
          },
          "710390202": {
            "id": "710390202",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "On account of the invaluable help that her maps have brought to the Huishan Hall, the Ministry of Civil Affairs has decided to make an exception for her and... Let me see, invite her to be formally accepted as a consultant and guide.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390203"
            ]
          },
          "710390203": {
            "id": "710390203",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Congratulations to her are in order — it seems that all that running around wasn't for naught.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390204"
            ]
          },
          "710390204": {
            "id": "710390204",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "She left.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390205"
            ]
          },
          "710390205": {
            "id": "710390205",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Left? What do you mean? Do you mean she left first? But the Millelith didn't tell me of anyone leaving The Chasm...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390206"
            ]
          },
          "710390206": {
            "id": "710390206",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Zhiqiong left the team.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390207"
            ]
          },
          "710390207": {
            "id": "710390207",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Eh? Uh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390208"
            ]
          },
          "710390208": {
            "id": "710390208",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Wait! Wait!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390209"
            ]
          },
          "710390209": {
            "id": "710390209",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Hang on a moment, you mean she left the exploration team?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390210"
            ]
          },
          "710390210": {
            "id": "710390210",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "As in, Zhiqiong left the team?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390211"
            ]
          },
          "710390211": {
            "id": "710390211",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yes! Which part of that didn't you get?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390212"
            ]
          },
          "710390212": {
            "id": "710390212",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "...I get it. I will put a search and rescue party together immediately. If she is still in The Chasm, we should be able to find her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390213"
            ]
          },
          "710390213": {
            "id": "710390213",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "She might just be doing something harebrained again, or perhaps she left for another reason... But regardless, we must find her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390214"
            ]
          },
          "710390214": {
            "id": "710390214",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "In her current condition, working away from the team is simply far too reckless...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390216",
              "710390218"
            ]
          },
          "710390216": {
            "id": "710390216",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "No, I don't reckon so... I suppose it's about time I stepped in as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390233"
            ]
          },
          "710390233": {
            "id": "710390233",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll be there if you need me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390234"
            ]
          },
          "710390234": {
            "id": "710390234",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon too! We can't just leave our junior adventurer behind!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390235"
            ]
          },
          "710390235": {
            "id": "710390235",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We'll look out while on the road as well. Who knows, maybe we'll bump into her somehow!"
          },
          "710390218": {
            "id": "710390218",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "She's a restless one, but whatever the case, we are still friends. I might not be the friendliest person around, but I don't simply forget friendships just like that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390219"
            ]
          },
          "710390219": {
            "id": "710390219",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "She's always talking about some big adventurer's dream or something, and she's actually been injured quite seriously several times before. Nearly bit it on at least one occasion, too. And here I thought she'd settled down for a bit...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390220"
            ]
          },
          "710390220": {
            "id": "710390220",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "I'd hoped that she'd have forgotten those unrealistic dreams of hers already. Roald... Stanley... It's not all wine and roses with them, you know!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710390221"
            ]
          },
          "710390221": {
            "id": "710390221",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "*sigh* But I never expected... To be honest, I was starting to wonder if asking you to come to The Chasm was the right decision... If we hadn't, she might not have had a fire lit under her again..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}